  "name": "Order Entry Validation Agent",
  "headline": "Turn inbound purchase orders into validated draft sales orders",
  "summary": "Give a sales operations team one assistant that reads each customer purchase order, checks prices and terms against the accepted quote, catches invalid product configurations, classifies the order, and hands the specialist a draft sales order with every exception called out.",
